# Root .dockerignore. Each service (apps/api, apps/web) builds from its own
# directory as the Docker build context (see infra/docker-compose.yml) and
# has its own .dockerignore — this one only applies if an image is ever
# built using the repo root as context.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
.git
.gitignore
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.log
.DS_Store
Docs/
project-specs/
project-tasks/
